COMPILATION OF: E46L7

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L7 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 17 BYTES
c 0000 REC STRUCTURE LEVEL 1, MEMBERS 2 AUTOMATIC
c 0000 .LINE CHAR(14) VARYING MEMBER
c 000F .NXT FIXED BINARY(15,0) MEMBER
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L7

   1 a 0000 E46L7:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   dcl 1 rec, 2 line char(14) varying, 2 nxt fixed bin(15);
   4 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   5 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('L7OUT DAT');
   6 c 0023   put file(outf) list(line);
   7 c 003B   put file(outf) list(nxt);
   8 c 0055   close file(outf);
   9 a 005B end E46L7;

CODE SIZE = 005E
DATA AREA = 001A
FREE SYMS = 388B
END  COMPILATION
